<title>UK: McDonald's sets 200 mln mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>McDonald's sets 200 mln mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MCDONALD'S CORP</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     2.50	MATURITY    19.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  92.725    PAY DATE    19.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    91.0	SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.725     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL 120</p>
<p> NOTES	MCDONALD'S CORP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
